<%#
# A config page

Every config page except the AI models one. The settings the owner really sets are in view, in groups; the technical
ones are folded under «Для разработчика»; a setting that does nothing is not drawn at all (its stored value is never
touched: a setting that is not drawn is not sent). The layout of each page is SuperAdmin::AppConfigLayout. Titles and
hints are Russian (SuperAdmin::AppConfigLabels). Saving posts `app_config[<NAME>]` for the controls of the page to
`app_config#create`; a switch that changes the platform for every account asks first (see `_scripts`).

## Local variables (controller instance variables):

- `@config`: the name of the page (general, facebook, ...).
- `@layout`: the `SuperAdmin::AppConfigLayout::Page` of the page.
- `@addresses`: the addresses to copy into the console of a service (SuperAdmin::AppConfigAddresses).
- `@guards`: key => `SuperAdmin::AppConfigGuards::Guard` of the switches that ask before they change.
- `@app_config`: name => stored value (a secret is not in it: its state is `@configured_secrets`).
- `@configured_secrets`: the secrets of the page that have a stored value.
- `@installation_configs`: name => entry of installation_config.yml.
%>
<%= form_with url: super_admin_app_config_url(config: @config), method: :post, local: true, class: 'flex flex-col gap-5', data: { config_form: true } do %>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6" data-testid="config-fields">
    <% @layout.sections.each do |section| %>
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3" data-section="<%= section.id || 'main' %>">
        <% if section.id %>
          <div class="admin-block__head">
            <h2 class="admin-block__title"><%= t("super_admin.app_config.layout.sections.#{@config}.#{section.id}.title") %></h2>
            <p class="admin-block__hint"><%= t("super_admin.app_config.layout.sections.#{@config}.#{section.id}.hint") %></p>
          </div>
        <% end %>
        <div class="admin-fields">
          <% section.keys.each do |key| %>
            <%= render 'config_field', key: key %>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </section>
    <% end %>

    <%= render 'config_addresses' if @addresses.any? %>
    <%= render 'config_developer' if @layout.developer_block? %>
  </div>

  <div class="form-actions">
    <%= submit_tag t('super_admin.app_config.save'), name: nil %>
  </div>
<% end %>
